version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mariamarcelinaw/TRACE-CXR"
abstract: >-
  Historical training code, frozen-model release, CPU-only evidence checker and aggregate results for a controlled evaluation of
  reliability-gated InceptionV3/Swin-B fusion and calibration transport for
  pneumonia classification on chest X-rays.
